<title>INDIA: India soymeal, rapeseed fall, soybean, oil steady.</title>
<headline>India soymeal, rapeseed fall, soybean, oil steady.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean and soyoil prices were steady on Tuesday, but soymeal and rapeseed extraction prices fell on reduced export demand, dealers said.</p>
<p>Soymeal yellow was $280 per tonne in export for November, December and January shipment for new season crop. Rapeseed extraction was $125 per tonne in export. Rapeseed extraction was 4,300 rupees FOR Bedibunder and was 4,250 rupees FOR Bhavnagar.</p>
